---
/** ReliablePythonWorkbench — the small Python patterns around an AI model. */
---
<svg class="diagram-svg" viewBox="0 0 780 390" role="img" aria-label="A handwritten workbench groups reliable Python patterns around an AI application. Type hints and dataclasses define data, comprehensions and generators process and stream it, decorators and context managers add shared behaviour and cleanup, and exceptions plus logs make failures visible. A project layout holds the pieces in separate files.">
  <text x="390" y="32" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-hand)" font-size="27" fill="var(--ink)">reliable Python around the model</text>
  <rect x="28" y="58" width="226" height="125" rx="14" fill="var(--paper-raise)" stroke="var(--blueprint)" stroke-width="3"/>
  <text x="141" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-hand)" font-size="21" fill="var(--ink)">describe data</text>
  <text x="50" y="117" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">type hints → expected shape</text>
  <text x="50" y="143" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">dataclass → related fields</text>
  <text x="50" y="169" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">validate at boundaries</text>
  <rect x="276" y="58" width="226" height="125" rx="14" fill="var(--paper-raise)" stroke="var(--ch1)" stroke-width="3"/>
  <text x="389" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-hand)" font-size="21" fill="var(--ink)">move data</text>
  <text x="298" y="117" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">comprehension → short map/filter</text>
  <text x="298" y="143" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">generator → one at a time</text>
  <text x="298" y="169" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">stream large work safely</text>
  <rect x="524" y="58" width="226" height="125" rx="14" fill="var(--paper-raise)" stroke="var(--alert)" stroke-width="3"/>
  <text x="637" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-hand)" font-size="21" fill="var(--ink)">wrap behaviour</text>
  <text x="546" y="117" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">decorator → retry / timing</text>
  <text x="546" y="143" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">with → always clean up</text>
  <text x="546" y="169" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">keep core logic focused</text>
  <path d="M141 190 V235 M389 190 V235 M637 190 V235" stroke="var(--ch1)" stroke-width="3"/>
  <rect x="145" y="237" width="490" height="88" rx="14" fill="var(--highlight)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="390" y="267" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-hand)" font-size="22" fill="var(--ink)">make failures useful</text>
  <text x="174" y="296" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">specific exceptions</text>
  <text x="367" y="296" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">safe structured logs</text>
  <text x="540" y="296" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">tests + clear layout</text>
  <text x="390" y="366" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-hand)" font-size="17" fill="var(--alert)">model code is one part; reliability lives in the Python around it</text>
</svg>
